Cra: no On startup page in chrome://settings, as in Arc (its settings bundle
sets onStartup:false). CEF writes session.restore_on_startup at every profile
load from persist_session_cookies (chrome_browser_context.cc), and Cra's
sidebar restores its own tabs, so the page's choice never stuck and never
did anything: it snapped back to "Continue where you left off" (X DM 7 Nov
2026). Choosing "New tab page" would only have dropped session cookies.

